{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the wild, action-packed party game Croc Royale, only the most fierce (and hilarious) crocodile makes it out alive! Step into the scaly shoes of a competitive croc and dive straight into a ridiculous variety of crazy game modes, outrageous challenges, and unpredictable arenas. Whether you're fighting in a forest or on the beach, there's always a lot of rivalry, laughter, and mayhem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select from an assortment of customizable Crocs, each featuring unique amusing skins and hats, and participate in intense online\u00a0multiplayer combat with your friends. Use your acute intuition and wild power-ups to outsmart and outchomp your opponents. But be aware that timing and sheer willpower, not just strength, are being tested here.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861980?t=1755289047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861980?t=1755289047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861980/e0767adc1cf8b93e37ee2c3d9e863e98c025cf54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755289047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861980/e0767adc1cf8b93e37ee2c3d9e863e98c025cf54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755289047","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is a lot of blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the wild, action-packed party game Croc Royale, only the most fierce (and hilarious) crocodile makes it out alive! Step into the scaly shoes of a competitive croc and dive straight into 